              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngangomuso, efuna ukwazi iqiniso, ukuthi kungani amangalelwe ngamaJuda, wamkhulula eziboshweni, wayala ukuba abapristi abakhulu nomphakathi wonke wabo beze, wamehlisa uPawulu, wammisa phambi kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
